<h2>Hire Recommendation</h2>
<ul><li>[ ] Strong Yes — exceptional across multiple competencies</li><li>[ ] Yes — meets bar</li><li>[ ] Maybe — meets bar in some competencies, gaps in others</li><li>[ ] No — does not meet bar</li><li>[ ] Strong No — clear disqualifier identified</li></ul>
